%
% Merge notes:
% 1. Copy the entries only. This header contains no at-sign, and no comment sits between entries, because
%    paper/springer/build.sh splits the bibliography on at-signs and asserts that each arXiv-only entry ends
%    with a closing brace; a comment between entries breaks that assertion.
% 2. Every key except yang2026concurrencycontrol, bavaresco2025llms, ye2025justice and thakur2025judging already
%    exists in paper/refs.bib. Replace those entries; appending them makes BibTeX stop on a repeated key.
% 3. build.sh appends doi = {10.48550/arXiv.<id>} to every arXiv-only entry, so the doi lines below duplicate it
%    and BibTeX warns "I'm ignoring <key>'s extra "doi" field". Drop the doi line on merge, or make build.sh
%    skip entries that already carry a doi.
% 4. With the pdflatex class option, sn-jnl does not load breakurl, so the style prints a url field through a
%    \textsf fallback that fails on underscores. The two ICLR entries therefore carry no url (the proceedings
%    URLs contain "paper_files"; they are listed in the .md file). PMLR entries carry no publisher field, because
%    the style prints "PMLR, ???" when a publisher has no address.
% 5. "Mihaela {van der Schaar}" is braced because the style otherwise drops the particle and prints "Schaar, M.".

